  <h3 class="pg-section-title">Basic</h3>
  <p class="pg-section-desc">Add <code>.sui-reveal</code> and the element fades up when it scrolls into view. Elements already on screen when the page loads are shown straight away, so nothing above the fold flashes. <button class="sui-btn sui-btn-sm" onclick="replayReveal(this)">Replay</button></p>
  <div class="pg-section-row">
    <div class="sui-card sui-reveal" style="padding:24px;max-width:360px;">
      <h4 style="margin-bottom:8px;">Fades up into view</h4>
      <p style="color:var(--sui-text-muted);font-size:14px;">Revealed once, the first time it enters the viewport.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
